# LIFE.genome — THE ONE LIFE (his 17:44 word: «one genome carrying all the things, grown and verified after 24 hours of testings …
# a proper one organism, that has ability to be intelligent when it is born as primitive»). DRAFT, NOT LIVE — the law of this file is
# docs/organs/NEXT-LIFE-PLAN-2026-09-22.md (§4 the laws L-1..L-14, §5 the line table, §6 the marks, §8 the launch sequence).
# = genome/G5.genome (the six seam lives' file) + every line the plan switches ON; every DRAFT line is re-checked against the LANDED
# parser at the pre-flight, and any line whose builder has not landed by the launch is turned #OFF WITH ITS REASON ON THE LINE —
# never removed, never silently. NMAX and the game's cadence are written by the pre-flight (L-3), not by hand.
# edit: Claude (Fable 5.1), 2026-09-22 18:2x +0400.
