SURPRISE floor 0.05 predicted mind-cell                            # DRAFT (builder B, L-4): the mind's expected cell reaches the eye; the eye stamps the residual; a glance under the floor is a CONFIRMED (cheap) moment — his 17:28 word: keep the gate on
DELIVER  where fixation when instant act glance
SENSE    ear    letters 8
SENSE    colour rg by 4x4 under the glance fixed-gain
