# AREAS + MEET
AREA     sight  from retina
AREA     words  from ear
AREA     episodes from fast
MEET     sight  words
# GROW / WIRE / SHRINK
BIRTH    novelty  cos<0.952
BIRTH    error    misfires 3
BUDGET   400 per arrival
ARRIVAL  never-heard word
NMAX     6000    # DRAFT: written by the pre-flight (L-3: births/hour × 24 × 1.5, ≥ 4000; the game's cadence the knob above 8000); 6000 is the estimate from L5's series at a slower game
KWTA     5
HEBB     window 1                                 # the window IS one moment by construction (wiring happens inside `moment`); any other value refuses
DELTA    lr 0.05
PRUNE    w<0.02 after 3 chances
MERGE    cos>0.9969 same-answer
SCALE    every 1250 moments                       # re-based for five moments a canvas (L-7): the wall-clock cadence of G5's 1000 kept
CYCLE    grow to 0.9 nmax then consolidate
THRESH   cell own band history 30                 # DRAFT (builder A, L-6): each cell keeps the cosines of the glances it answered; its p5 is its own floor (BCM's shape, ADAPTS)
ANSWER   resembles under own-band; unknown below 0.911   # DRAFT (builder A, L-6): «X» / «I don't know what it is, but it resembles X» / «I don't know»; 0.911 = gate G-a's between-p95 on this front
# MEMORY, fast and slow
FAST     episodes 20000 keys sight words surprise sound   # DRAFT (builder D): + sound (the ear-sound trait)
MOMENT   keys sight words surprise where when act source
SLEEP    every 2500 moments replay 200 by surprise        # re-based for five moments a canvas (L-7): G5's 2000 kept in wall-clock
# PREDICT — the one modulator
PREDICT  next glance; error scales delta 0.5..2.0; ranks replay; grades act; error comparator
FILE     claim route decider due
# ATTENTION / CURIOSITY / METACOGNITION
CURIOSITY interests 50 operators recombine generalize specialize bridge
PARK     after 3 identical dead-ends reopen on new-sense
SELF     from body; beliefs about itself; skip thinks when backlog > 200   # DRAFT (builder A, L-9): the mind reads its own numbers and acts on one of them
# THINKING
INDUCE   rule from 5 episodes no counter
DEDUCE   one step
BELIEF   clash opens never overwrites
THINK    every 10 canvases; on its own thread; lands next boundary   # DRAFT (builder E, L-5): launched on a frozen copy at a boundary; applied at the next; the mind waits if late — replay identical by construction
EXAM     every 500 canvases
SIT      exam every 500 canvases; the score returns as a sense
FROZEN   after 50 cells
# LANGUAGE
SENTENCE two-word frames from co-occurring words; judged by the eye; never next-token   # DRAFT (builder C, L-11): a frame = two words that met in one instant ≥ 5 times, FILED with its episodes
MOUTH    say one frame per think; journaled                                              # DRAFT (builder C, L-11): the mouth says a frame as an `is` question the next frame grades
QUESTION from wants; forms what-is is which; to the world door                          # DRAFT (builder C, L-10): a wordless sight's 2nd showing, a failed rule, a clash, a park → a question row the world answers by showing
# HANDS + WORLD
WORLD    drawn every 5 s arrivals every 4 h; folder world/; web 0 per hour by curiosity   # 24 h = six windows; the plant by the unit's PLANT_AFTER=15000 (hour ≈ 21); web 0 = the web door is implemented by nothing
WORLD    game babyai-gotolocal every 15 s; seed 20260923; frames pov 7x7 tile 32; consequence: his act chooses the next frame   # DRAFT: cadence written by the pre-flight (L-3); the ACT is the MIND's (builder D, L-8)
HANDS    jail alpha3/hands/jail_run shelf world/programs cpu 10 mem 512 wall 20          # DRAFT (builder F, L-12): rung 1 — choose from the shelf; the output rendered as a canvas the eye sees
ACT      glance open ask turn step say run                                                # DRAFT (builders C, D, F): the whole vocabulary; an act with no road yet journals «no road»
OUTCOME  act to episode; error grades it; ranks replay
# ANSWER
ABSTAIN  second/best > 0.85
ASK      what-is show is which why                # `why` = the addresses questions.why() returns (builder A); `next` dropped — no mechanism predicts a next thing; RECALL k removed — it reached no call site
